{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>PureCinema 是一款結合電影與劇集資料庫、演員面孔搜尋及個人片單管理的 App，適合想快速查找作品、記錄評分與觀看清單的電影迷。它可透過掃描演員面孔自動搜尋名字，並根據你的片單提供下一部觀看建議。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-56.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>面孔搜尋與片單管理</h2>\n<p>PureCinema 內建收錄數百萬電影與電視節目的資料庫，可透過掃描演員面孔自動搜尋名字；你也能把作品加入個人片單，利用評分系統整理觀看清單，並根據片單獲得下一部觀看建議。資料只儲存在裝置上，不會傳送出去，且採一次性購買，無需訂閱。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-6-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-7-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-8-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-9-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：PureCinema</li><li>應用類別：Entertainment</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/purecinema/id6757587184?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T20:20:50.440710+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T20:03:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:38:59.989829+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T20:18:33.342051+00:00","content_hash":"b01eab939cb8607d8ccf63154c645e26ab1b2846e59bba0b76627b1bae0351c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}